{"version":1,"id":"UCSTjtpqQ_1viKnykyZ1P_TQ","name":"Pecan Creek Ranch","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSTjtpqQ_1viKnykyZ1P_TQ","main":true,"sourceId":"9111b33d-b595-42f9-876d-5cb1146826e9","profile":{"channelId":"UCSTjtpqQ_1viKnykyZ1P_TQ","name":"Pecan Creek Ranch","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSTjtpqQ_1viKnykyZ1P_TQ","handle":"@pecancreekeap","description":"* Information and education on mental health and wellness\n* Life and relationship lessons and insights we've gleaned from our work with people and horses\n* Tips and how-to's for Professionals in the equine assisted services and mental health and wellness field\n* Reviews of tools and resources that help us in our practice\n* A little light entertainment about the horses, cows, and other animals at PCR.\n\nPecan Creek Ranch is an 18 acre equine assisted services facility in Georgetown, TX. Our mission is to transform relationships one connection at a time. Our vision is to unlock a world of joy, worthiness, love, healing and untapped potential for all.\n \nWe provide psychotherapy, coaching, workshops, seminars, and professional consultations. All our services are based on interpersonal neurobiology and the principles of Natural Lifemanship™, and a deep and growing knowledge of trauma-informed care. We partner with horses for much of this work and incorporate them in this channel as well.","thumbnailUrl":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/oVsZ5OpsO7R3rVBfaBVRZWid8Co9OSV-DnUAQ7ScU6JG9tbp-ApNaplYDxjTSgRxjCM7c5hilI4=s900-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","subscriberText":"374 subscribers","videoCountText":"190 videos","countrySelfReported":"United States","links":[{"title":"Pecan Creek Ranch","url":"https://www.pecancreekeap.com/","displayedText":"pecancreekeap.com"},{"title":"PCR Store","url":"https://www.pecancreekeap.com/shop","displayedText":"pecancreekeap.com/shop"}],"observedAt":"2026-09-16T03:44:50.676Z","source":"youtubejs"},"assessment":{"channelId":"UCSTjtpqQ_1viKnykyZ1P_TQ","relevance":"strong